{"ticker":"VTRS","updated":"2026-11-28T02:06:51Z","profile":{"longName":"Viatris Inc.","shortName":"Viatris Inc.","sector":"Healthcare","industry":"Drug Manufacturers - Specialty & Generic","country":"United States","website":"https://www.viatris.com","fullTimeEmployees":30000,"marketCap":23158386688,"trailingPE":null,"forwardPE":7.127559,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":1.5725229,"pegRatio":null,"targetMeanPrice":21.90909,"targetHighPrice":28.0,"targetLowPrice":14.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":11,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":-0.003,"earningsGrowth":null,"grossMargins":0.41134,"operatingMargins":0.11486,"profitMargins":-0.04127,"totalRevenue":14726899712,"beta":0.871,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":21.2,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":10.59,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":2.42},"summary":"Viatris Inc., together with its subsidiaries, operates as a healthcare company in North America, Europe, China, Taiwan, Hong Kong, Japan, Australia, New Zealand, rest of Asia, Africa, Latin America, and the Middle East. It operates in four segments: Developed Markets, Greater China, JANZ, and Emerging Markets. The company offers prescription brand drugs, generic drugs, complex generic drugs, and biosimilars. It also provides drugs in various therapeutic areas covering various noncommunicable and infectious diseases, including cardiovascular, CNS and anesthesia, dermatology, diabetes and metabolism, eye care, gastroenterology, immunology, oncology, and respiratory and allergy, as well as support services, such as diagnostic clinics, educational seminars, and digital tools to help patients better manage their health. In addition, the company offers medicines in the form of oral solid doses, injectables, and complex dosage forms to retail and pharmacy establishments, wholesalers and distributors, payers, insurers and governments, and institutions. It distributes its products through pharmaceutical wholesalers/distributors, pharmaceutical retailers, institutional pharmacies, mail-order and e-commerce pharmacies, and specialty pharmacies under the Lyrica, Lipitor, Celebrex, Viagra, Creon, Influvac, Wixela Inhub, EpiPen Auto-Injector, Fraxiparine, Yupelri, Norvasc, Amitiza, Effexor, ","summary_zh":"Viatris Inc. 及其子公司作為一家醫療保健公司在北美、歐洲、中國、台灣、香港、日本、澳洲、紐西蘭、亞洲其他地區、非洲、拉丁美洲和中東地區開展業務。其業務分為四個部分：已開發市場、大中華區、JANZ 和新興市場。該公司提供處方品牌藥、仿製藥、複雜仿製藥和生物相似藥。它還提供涵蓋各種非傳染性和傳染性疾病的多個治療領域的藥物，包括心血管、中樞神經系統和麻醉、皮膚科、糖尿病和代謝、眼科護理、胃腸病學、免疫學、腫瘤學、呼吸和過敏學，以及支持服務，例如診斷診所、教育研討會和數位工具，以幫助患者更好地管理自己的健康。此外，該公司還向零售和藥房、批發商和分銷商、付款人、保險公司、政府和機構提供口服固體劑量、注射和複雜劑型的藥物。該公司透過藥品批發商/經銷商、藥品零售商、機構藥局、郵購和電子商務藥局以及專業藥局分銷其產品，旗下產品包括 Lyrica、Lipitor、Celebrex、Viagra、Creon、Influvac、Wixela Inhub、EpiPen 自動注射器、Fraxiparine、Influvac、Wixela Inhub、EpiPen 自動注射器、Fraxiparine、Yupffelri、Norvas、Yup","sector_zh":"衛生保健","industry_zh":"藥品製造商 - 特用藥品和非專利藥品","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-29","o":9.55,"h":9.65,"l":9.47,"c":9.62,"v":7645400},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":9.61,"h":9.91,"l":9.55,"c":9.9,"v":9073900},{"t":"2025-10-01","o":9.92,"h":10.17,"l":9.92,"c":10.09,"v":9501100},{"t":"2025-10-02","o":10.08,"h":10.19,"l":9.94,"c":10.11,"v":6961100},{"t":"2025-10-03","o":10.18,"h":10.38,"l":10.06,"c":10.19,"v":7009600},{"t":"2025-10-06","o":10.18,"h":10.21,"l":10.09,"c":10.13,"v":7146500},{"t":"2025-10-07","o":10.12,"h":10.26,"l":10.06,"c":10.14,"v":6546100},{"t":"2025-10-08","o":10.12,"h":10.17,"l":9.93,"c":9.97,"v":6981600},{"t":"2025-10-09","o":10.01,"h":10.15,"l":9.95,"c":9.99,"v":7415400},{"t":"2025-10-10","o":10.0,"h":10.07,"l":9.69,"c":9.74,"v":7665400},{"t":"2025-10-13","o":9.78,"h":9.97,"l":9.74,"c":9.86,"v":7622400},{"t":"2025-10-14","o":9.75,"h":9.97,"l":9.73,"c":9.93,"v":6459700},{"t":"2025-10-15","o":10.02,"h":10.17,"l":9.86,"c":9.98,"v":9233600},{"t":"2025-10-16","o":10.08,"h":10.2,"l":10.01,"c":10.1,"v":6150300},{"t":"2025-10-17","o":10.09,"h":10.2,"l":10.07,"c":10.17,"v":5505500},{"t":"2025-10-20","o":10.17,"h":10.32,"l":10.13,"c":10.31,"v":6620700},{"t":"2025-10-21","o":10.31,"h":10.44,"l":10.3,"c":10.39,"v":6282000},{"